    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints : } \\begin{array}{rlr} \n& I=\\int t d t & \\sin ^{-1} x=t \\\\\n& =\\frac{1}{2} t^2+c & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}} d x=d t \\\\\n& =\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\sin ^{-1} x\\right)^2+c &\n\\end{array}\n$$"
